book dynamic-values
@define ENABLED YES
@if ENABLED == YES
note tag with enabled being YES
enabled returns boolean begin paragraph
    give yes
end paragraph
@else
@error Boolean alias preprocessor condition failed
@endif

Switch means flag
value global-value as anything is 7

Parcel begin record
    field item as anything
end record

Envelope begin choice
    when Data holding anything
    when Empty
end choice

echo receives input as anything returns anything begin paragraph
    give input
end paragraph

make returns anything begin paragraph
    give "returned"
end paragraph

main returns override integer begin paragraph
    value flag as Switch is no
    value inferred is YES
    when not (enabled with nothing) or not inferred or flag then give 1 end when
    consider YES
        when YES then say "yes"
        when NO then give 1
    end consider
    say (1 becomes boolean) and not (0 becomes flag)
    variable item as anything is 42
    value original is item
    set item to "ready"
    when not (anything-is of text with item) then give 2 end when
    when anything-is of override integer with item then give 3 end when
    say item becomes text
    say original becomes override integer
    say global-value becomes override integer
    say (echo with input being yes) becomes boolean
    say (make with nothing) becomes text
    value parcel-value is build Parcel with item being 2.5
    say parcel-value.item becomes floating
    set parcel-value.item to "field"
    say parcel-value.item becomes text
    value variant as Envelope is Envelope.Data holding 9
    consider variant
        when Envelope.Data holding held then say held becomes override integer
        when Envelope.Empty then give 4
    end consider
    variable values as array of anything is [1, "two", no]
    say (values at 0) becomes override integer
    say (values at 1) becomes text
    say (values at 2) becomes flag
    set values at 0 to "changed"
    append 3.5 to values
    say (values at 0) becomes text
    say (values at 3) becomes floating
    value boxed-array as anything is values
    value recovered is boxed-array becomes array of anything
    say (recovered at 1) becomes text
    give 0
end paragraph
